msgstr "**Blueprint**"

#: ../../tools/catalog_item_types.rst:38
msgid ""
"Deploys a multi-tier application from an App Blueprint (Morpheus, "
"Terraform, ARM, CloudFormation, Kubernetes, Helm)"
msgstr ""
"Implementa una aplicación multicapa desde un Blueprint de aplicación "
"(Morpheus, Terraform, ARM, CloudFormation, Kubernetes, Helm)"

